        "id": "code-recipe-argon-long-decode-interactions",
        "heading": "Code Recipe: Gọi Gemini 4 Argon Long Decode (>64K output) đúng chuẩn Interactions API v1 & tránh HTTP 400",
        "language": "python",
        "filename": "argon_long_decode_erp_refactor.py",
        "description": "Mẫu triển khai chuẩn bằng SDK mới google-genai >= 3.2.0 (thay thế hoàn toàn google-generativeai đã deprecated): sử dụng client.interactions.create với background=true để mở khóa long decode vượt 65.536 token mà không gặp lỗi HTTP 400, bỏ temperature/top_p (bị deprecated trong Interactions API) và tái sử dụng state phía server 55 ngày qua previous_interaction_id.",
        "code": "import os\nimport time\nfrom google import genai\n\n# Yeu cau: pip install \"google-genai>=3.2.0\"\nclient = genai.Client(api_key=os.environ[\"GEMINI_API_KEY\"])\n\n# 1. Khoi tao phien Audit Monorepo ERP voi tien to tinh >= 4.096 tokens de huong Implicit Cache 95%\nSTATIC_ERP_PREFIX = \"\"\"[SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & POSTGRESQL FORCE RLS CONTRACT]\n- Multi-tenant table isolation: tenant_id UUID NOT NULL + FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY.\n- MISA Accounting webhook idempotency key: sha256(tenant_id + invoice_no + fiscal_year).\n- ... (Nap schema 12 phan he ERP + Zod contracts > 4.096 tokens o day) ...\n\"\"\"\n\ndef run_argon_long_decode(refactor_task: str) -> str:\n    # Khong truyen temperature/top_p (da bi ignore/deprecated trong Interactions API)\n    # Khong truyen thinking_level=\"minimal\" vi Gemini 4 Argon chi nhan low | medium | high\n    interaction = client.interactions.create(\n        model=\"gemini-4-argon\",\n        input=f\"{STATIC_ERP_PREFIX}\\n\\n[REFACTOR TASK]\\n{refactor_task}\",\n        background=True,  # BAT BUOC = True neu max_output_tokens > 65536 (tranh HTTP 400)\n        store=True,       # Luu state phia server 55 ngay cho luot follow-up qua previous_interaction_id\n        config={\n            \"thinking_level\": \"high\",\n            \"max_output_tokens\": 180000,\n        },\n    )\n\n    # Poll ket qua bat dong bo an toan\n    while interaction.status in (\"in_progress\", \"queued\"):\n        time.sleep(3)\n        interaction = client.interactions.get(id=interaction.id)\n\n    if interaction.status != \"completed\":\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Argon long-decode failed: {interaction.status} - {interaction.error}\")\n\n    # Tiep tuc vong lap review ma khong gui lai toan bo context:\n    # follow_up = client.interactions.create(model=\"gemini-4-argon\", previous_interaction_id=interaction.id, ...)\n    return interaction.outputs[-1].text\n"
